@base = http://localhost:5080/api
@token = demo-alice
@session = 09af1f5f-353b-49da-8642-704d099d1bb1

### List authorized cases
GET {{base}}/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Discrete document action; reuse key only for retries, change it for a fresh action
GET {{base}}/cases/1/documents/101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: example-document-1

### Add a note (send twice to demonstrate deduplication)
POST {{base}}/cases/1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: example-note-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"Reviewed executor instructions."}

### Start viewing; use a fresh session GUID for each new viewing session
PUT {{base}}/cases/1/documents/101/views/{{session}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: example-start-1

### End viewing after a few seconds (same end key on retries)
POST {{base}}/cases/1/documents/101/views/{{session}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: example-end-1

### Timeline (eventually consistent)
GET {{base}}/cases/1/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unauthorized tenant: expected 404
GET {{base}}/cases/2/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pause, add notes, arm failure, then resume
POST {{base}}/demo/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Force rollback of next projection write
POST {{base}}/demo/fail-next
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resume
POST {{base}}/demo/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Queue inspection
GET {{base}}/demo/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
